# Shared department modules pattern

**One Angular module / one URL** linked from many department dashboards.  
Do **not** fork per department. Scope with `localStorage.getItem('department')`.

## Checklist (any new shared module)

1. Single lazy route in `app.module.ts`
2. Pass department into every list API; backend filters by it
3. Interpolate `{{department}}` in titles
4. Shared sidebar link component on each dept hub
5. Never copy the module under `qa/`, `production/`, etc.

