## PM / Inspection Intimation (`/preventiveimain`)

- Frontend: `src/app/preventiveimtimation`
- API: `phpmedicap/engineering/preventive.php`
- List: `getIntimations&due_type=Preventive|Inspection&Inti_department=<dept>`
- Filter: `equipment.department = Inti_department`
- Flow: Engg send (`Inprocess`) → owning dept Accept (`Accepted`) → Engg execute (gated until Accepted)
- Sidebar: almost every hub → `routerLink="/preventiveimain"`

Do not change intimation status semantics unless the user asks.
